{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0996a0b8bb0b7601138dab472b94ee854e0a2c4963c8074d164087e5cf8eb490", "ja": "（星梨花の出演したひな祭りパレードが無事終わった。\nそろそろ、帰り支度も済んだ頃かな……）", "zh": "（星梨花参加的女儿节游行顺利结束了。差不多也该收拾好准备回去了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "24fd1af1ba2a44ab9db73bc1ec94a7c670c049f4db999974880556bed21af42f", "ja": "お、お待たせしました、{$P$}さん！\nごめんなさい、着替えに時間がかかっちゃって……。", "zh": "让、让您久等了，{$P$}先生！\n对不起，换衣服花了点时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ebeb8b4dd6f84239783d9b5f8a7f7c1529d35aaf4dad2fc673585e5db8a7aefe", "ja": "お疲れ様、星梨花。全然待ってないから大丈夫だよ。\nそれじゃあ帰ろうか。", "zh": "辛苦了，星梨花。完全没等多久，没关系的。\n那我们回去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "5f550340ff39d930b41583f703602d12ea51a015a742fcbf007beb899ffab310", "ja": "あ、あのっ……{$P$}さん。\nこのあと、ちょっとだけ寄り道していきませんか……？", "zh": "啊，那个……{$P$}先生。\n接下来，要不要稍微绕个路再走……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "5a68169b5ed3e5faff511c44b690a61bd15556f1cb1d549efd48b5760704aff6", "ja": "会場の近くで、まだ甘酒を配ってるって聞いたんです。\nだから、一緒に飲めたらなって思って……。", "zh": "我听说会场附近还在发放甘酒。\n所以想着，要是能一起喝就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1005_p", "source_sha256": "38a5390a495e55f9026b153800c37a3629f131d05f71be95d6616114a68862ae", "ja": "お、甘酒か。ひな祭りらしくていいな。\nそれじゃ少し寄っていくか！", "zh": "哦，是甘酒啊。很有女儿节的感觉，不错嘛。\n那我们就顺路过去喝一点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "de4dafa38f8bdcf3cfb88c35eaf02aa614e8d41997965e6b6860a3f38abcb999", "ja": "わあ、ありがとうございます！　お仕事の帰りに\nお酒を飲むなんて、なんだか大人の人みたいですね！", "zh": "哇，谢谢您！　工作结束回去的路上喝酒，\n总觉得就像大人一样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d767f479befd50813346883346edfefa732e39e84429abfade9746bd6483d75e", "ja": "はは、そうだな。桃の花も見頃みたいだし、\n景色を見ながら一緒に楽しもうか。", "zh": "哈哈，是啊。桃花好像也正是观赏时节，要不要一边欣赏景色，一边一起享受呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "fbe593a103f252718180a3fd7822fd25999f54bfa9bb6583032b7cb31892c071", "ja": "はい♪　えへへ、お酒を飲みながら話していること、\n今日はいっぱい教えてくださいね♪", "zh": "好♪　嘿嘿，今天请一边喝酒一边多跟我聊聊吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0392_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0392_1009_p", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
